{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"REV","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"啟示錄","commonName":"啟示錄","title":"啟示錄","order":66,"numberOfChapters":22,"sha256":"1c1809dc5c0852a24fd2e98a16f1c48a0099bb5a8076dad64ee116379fb4b925","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/REV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":22,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/REV/22.json","totalNumberOfVerses":405},"chapter":{"number":19,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["此後，我聽見好像群眾在天上大聲說：",{"text":"哈利路亞","poem":1},{"noteId":14},{"text":"！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"救恩、榮耀、權能都屬乎我們的上帝！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的判斷是真實公義的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他判斷了那用淫行敗壞世界的大淫婦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並且向淫婦討流僕人血的罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"給他們伸冤。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["又說：",{"text":"哈利路亞！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"燒淫婦的煙往上冒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到永永遠遠。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["那二十四位長老與四活物就俯伏敬拜坐寶座的上帝，說：",{"text":"阿們！哈利路亞！","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["羔羊的婚筵"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"有聲音從寶座出來說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝的眾僕人哪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡敬畏他的，無論大小，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都要讚美我們的上帝！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["我聽見好像群眾的聲音，眾水的聲音，大雷的聲音，說：",{"text":"哈利路亞！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為主－我們的上帝、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"全能者作王了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們要歡喜快樂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將榮耀歸給他。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為，羔羊婚娶的時候到了；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"新婦也自己預備好了，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就蒙恩得穿光明潔白的細麻衣。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"（這細麻衣就是聖徒所行的義。）","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["天使吩咐我說：「你要寫上：凡被請赴羔羊之婚筵的有福了！」又對我說：「這是上帝真實的話。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我就俯伏在他腳前要拜他。他說：「千萬不可！我和你，並你那些為耶穌作見證的弟兄同是作僕人的，你要敬拜上帝。」因為預言中的靈意乃是為耶穌作見證。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["騎白馬者"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我觀看，見天開了。有一匹白馬，騎在馬上的稱為誠信真實，他審判，爭戰，都按着公義。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他的眼睛如火焰，他頭上戴着許多冠冕；又有寫着的名字，除了他自己沒有人知道。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["他穿着濺了血的衣服；他的名稱為上帝之道。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["在天上的眾軍騎着白馬，穿着細麻衣，又白又潔，跟隨他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["有利劍從他口中出來，可以擊殺列國。他必用鐵杖轄管",{"noteId":15},"他們，並要踹全能上帝烈怒的酒醡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["在他衣服和大腿上有名寫着說：「萬王之王，萬主之主。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["我又看見一位天使站在日頭中，向天空所飛的鳥大聲喊着說：「你們聚集來赴上帝的大筵席，"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["可以吃君王與將軍的肉，壯士與馬和騎馬者的肉，並一切自主的為奴的，以及大小人民的肉。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["我看見那獸和地上的君王，並他們的眾軍都聚集，要與騎白馬的並他的軍兵爭戰。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["那獸被擒拿；那在獸面前曾行奇事、迷惑受獸印記和拜獸像之人的假先知，也與獸同被擒拿。他們兩個就活活地被扔在燒着硫磺的火湖裏；"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["其餘的被騎白馬者口中出來的劍殺了；飛鳥都吃飽了他們的肉。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":14,"caller":"-","text":"就是要讚美耶和華的意思","reference":{"chapter":19,"verse":1}},{"noteId":15,"caller":"-","text":"轄管：原文是牧","reference":{"chapter":19,"verse":15}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/REV/19.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/REV/20.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/REV/18.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}